        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Pues yo reconozco mi culpa, (Mi,m,0)(La,m,215)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "tengo siempre presente mi pecado: (Mi,m,290)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "contra Ti, contra Ti sólo pequé, (La,m,275)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "cometí la maldad que aborreces. (Mi,m,245)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "type": "collapsible-block",
      "id": "asamblea_anadie_2",
      "initialState": "collapsed",
      "triggerLine": "MISERICORDIA MÍA (Mi,m,0)",
      "sC": "ta as zindex junte",
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as sub"
        },
        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "En la sentencia tendrás razón, (Mi,m,0)(La,m,240)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "en el juicio resultarás inocente. (Mi,m,270)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Mira, en la culpa nací, (La,m,185)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "pecador me concibió mi madre. (Mi,m,240)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "type": "collapsible-block",
      "id": "asamblea_anadie_3",
      "initialState": "collapsed",
      "triggerLine": "MISERICORDIA MÍA (Mi,m,0)",
      "sC": "ta as zindex",
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as sub"
        },
        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Te gusta un corazón sincero, (Mi,m,0)(La,m,235)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "y en mi interiorme inculcas sabiduría. (Mi,m,310)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Rocíame con el hisopo: quedaré limpio; (La,m,320)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "lávame: quedaré más blanco que la nieve. (Mi,m,345)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "type": "collapsible-block",
      "id": "asamblea_anadie_4",
      "initialState": "collapsed",
      "triggerLine": "MISERICORDIA MÍA (Mi,m,0)",
