        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Líbrame de la sangre, oh Dios, (Mi,m,0)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Dios, Salvador mío,, (La,m,150)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "y cantará mi lengua tu justicia. (Mi,m,230)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Señor, me abrirás los labios, (La,m,235)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "y mi boca proclamará tu alabanza. (Mi,m,265)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "type": "collapsible-block",
      "id": "asamblea_anadie_8",
      "initialState": "collapsed",
      "triggerLine": "MISERICORDIA MÍA (Mi,m,0)",
      "sC": "ta as zindex",
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as sub"
        },
        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Los sacrificios no te satisfacen: (Mi,m,0)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "si te ofreciera un holocausto, tú no lo querrías. (La,m,435)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Mi sacrificio es un espíritu quebrantado; (Mi,m,335)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "un corazón quebrantado y humillado, (La,m,260)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "tú no lo desprecias., (Mi,m,135)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "type": "collapsible-block",
      "id": "asamblea_anadie_9",
      "initialState": "collapsed",
      "triggerLine": "MISERICORDIA MÍA (Mi,m,0)",
      "sC": "ta as zindex",
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as sub"
        },
        {
          "line": "MISERICORDIA MÍA, MISERICORDIA (Mi,m,0)(Re,,210)(Mi,m,240)",
          "sC": "as"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Señor, por tu bondad, favorece a Sión, (Mi,m,0)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "reconstruye las murallas de Jerusalén: (La,m,335)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "Entonces aceptarás los sacrificios rituales, (Mi,m,360)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "ofrendas y holocaustos,, (La,m,175)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "sobre tu altar se inmolarán novillos. (Mi,m,295)",
      "sC": "junte"
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1 junte"
    },
